<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Steers shares issue raises 12.36 mln rand.</title>
<headline>Steers shares issue raises 12.36 mln rand.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African restaurant chain Steers Holdings Ltd said on Monday that it had raised 12.36 million rand by an isssue of 2.7 million new ordinary shares and a simuilar anmount of new &quot;N&quot; shares.</p>
<p>The cash is to go to settle an initial one million rand payment in the buy of the Speciality Franchising Trust and fund future retail outlet buys, the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
